{"id":"648038","name":"红糖味酵粄","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/648038/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"粘米粉","amount":"400g"}],"sub":[{"name":"碱面","amount":"2g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"粘米粉400g（即大米粉）。","img":"images/648038/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入少量的碱面。","img":"images/648038/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入400ml凉水。","img":"images/648038/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"搅拌细腻，呈酸奶状。","img":"images/648038/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"小锅中放入红糖和白糖。","img":"images/648038/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入剩下的400ml水。","img":"images/648038/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煮开。","img":"images/648038/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"冲入滚烫的红糖水，边倒边搅拌。","img":"images/648038/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/648038/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把米糊舀入小碗内。","img":"images/648038/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"大火蒸20分钟。","img":"images/648038/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"开盖后，蒸好的粄中间有个小窝窝。","img":"images/648038/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。香香软糯，入口爽滑，是非常美味的客家小吃！","img":"images/648038/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}